      ],
      "source": "https://unearththevoyage.com/california-volcano-gold-rush-history-food-adventure/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "George Hotel, on National Register of Historic Places, stands as a testament to Volcano's 19th‑century hospitality.",
